From e65e4e6dee5a6e922273b445f935d0e3752e236b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rdr-port <rdr-port@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 19:44:56 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 19/47] rdr-port: movie replacement: an MP4 played by the media
 engine on the D3D11 device (nv2a_d3d11_movie)

The title's thread asks and waits; the ack thread, which owns the device,
plays it at its next poll with the guest paused, letterboxed (3:2 frames
shown 4:3), until it ends or a skip key. The device is made with video
support, falling back to none (then no replacement).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
